---
title: Scout Agent Responsibilities
---
flowchart TB
    Statement([User states profile facts]) --> Extract[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>returns typed memory proposals]
    Extract --> Review{Visible approval}
    Review -->|approved| Profile[(User-scoped Scout profile)]
    Review -->|dismissed| NoWrite[Nothing saved]
    Review -->|approved| Facts[(Approved memory facts)]

    Trigger([Schedule or Look now]) --> Sweep[Scout sweep]
    Profile --> Sweep
    Facts --> Aim[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>aims subjects and vectors]
    Aim --> Sweep
    Sweep --> Sources[Feeds and bounded<br/>MCP/Tavily searches]
    Sources --> Safety[Structural filtering<br/>novelty · familiarity]
    Safety --> Ranking[Nomic semantic ranking<br/>interest strength]
    Ranking --> Precision[MiniLM cross-encoder<br/>reads each pair together]
    Precision --> Reorder[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>orders the shortlist]
    Facts --> Reorder
    Reorder --> Description[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>writes descriptions]
    Description --> Message[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>writes the message]
    Message --> Digest[One message per find]
    Digest --> Tapback([Thumbs up or down])
    Tapback --> Signal[(Recorded, unused so far)]

    Rule[Application code owns persistence,<br/>qualification, budgets and delivery]
    Rule -.-> Review
    Rule -.-> Safety
    Rule -.-> Ranking

    Clock[Times rendered in the reader's zone<br/>and links from the typed record<br/>never come from the model]
    Clock -.-> Message

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef model fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    classDef warning fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class Statement,Review,NoWrite,Trigger,Digest,Tapback interface;
    class Sweep,Sources,Safety,Ranking application;
    class Profile,Facts,Signal data;
    class Extract,Aim,Precision,Reorder,Description,Message model;
    class Rule,Clock warning;
